apps/web/CLAUDE.md
artifacts/*
!artifacts/.gitkeep
pcap_lab/catalog/*.gz
*.pcap
*.pcapng
!pcap_lab/fixtures/*.pcap
!pcap_lab/fixtures/*.pcapng
